{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","阿尔萨"],["/names/en","Alsa"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵活飘逸的法师，擅长风筝她的对手。"],["/description_i18n/en","A graceful Mage skilled at outmaneuvering opponents."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","大家，并肩作战吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's team up and do this!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","咦，我、我也进步了吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Hm... did I... actually get better? Yahoo!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","所向无前！进攻！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","No holding back, attack!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","对不起，老爹……我……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Sorry, pops... I, ugh..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","多亏了大家帮忙，谢谢！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Big thanks to all of you for helping out!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","未来的道路，就一起来开拓吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Let's pave the way for the future together!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","探索队快回来了吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The exploration team, they'll come back soon, right?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","最近人越来越多了呀，好，加油吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","We've been seeing more and more people lately... Alright, let's give it our all!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","这次一定要成功，又失败了，下次再试试吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","It's gotta work this time... Yes! Hmm... ugh, not again... Hah, let's try again next time."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","这次一定要成功，以后要陪着我呀。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Mm... come on... Mm... Whoa! You're going to stick with me from now on, won't you?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这、这是送给我的吗？！谢谢！我很喜欢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Is this for me?! I love it!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","咦？礼物？！真没想到！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Huh? A gift?! Wasn't expecting that!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","椅子好软啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This chair is so soft!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","呼啊啊，有点困了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","*Yawn* I'm feeling sleepy..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有什么水果吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Do you serve fruits?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪花！星星灯！好漂亮！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Snowflakes! Starry lights! Everything's so beautiful!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起来做节日大餐吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's make the banquet food together!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，好热闹啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow, I'm pumped up!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚一起去看灯吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's watch the lights together tonight!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说阿尔萨的头发虽然看起来蓬松柔软，但实际上又硬又韧——和她天生的鳞甲类似。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","It's said that, despite Alsa's hair looking fluffy and soft, it's actually hard and resilient, much like her natural hide."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说小时候的阿尔萨非常怕生，稍微戳一下就会团成球钻进地里，但在认识了索恩之后逐渐变得开朗起来了。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","When Alsa was young, she was extremely shy, curling into a tight ball at the slightest interaction. However, after meeting Soren, she became much more outgoing."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿尔萨并不是天生的大嗓门，但每天都要应付一大堆叽叽喳喳的吵闹小孩，任何人的声音都会逐渐变大的。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Alsa's voice wasn't always so loud, but dealing with a bunch of chattering, noisy children every day soon changed that."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿尔萨曾经想要成为一名大盾战士，这样就能更好地守护家人了。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Alsa once dreamt of becoming a mighty shield-bearing warrior to better defend her family."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“阿尔萨姐姐是最会玩游戏的！”“最会唱歌的！”“她总能找出好吃的！”"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","\"Alsa's the best to play games with!\" \"She's such a good singer!\" \"She always knows where to find the most delicious food!\"—From different children of the clan."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","沙漠干燥的天气经常会让阿尔萨尾巴的鳞片变脆磨损，她只能小心地修剪鳞片，再用石头把它打磨光滑。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","The dry desert weather often makes Alsa's tail scales brittle and frail. She has to carefully trim them and use stones to polish them smooth."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","阿尔萨很擅长忍耐饥渴，她对食物的消耗永远是族中最少的。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Alsa is selfless when it comes to food. She'll go without eating for days just so others can fill their bellies."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","阿尔萨非常羡慕那些能在篝火边翩翩起舞的族人，因为她总是会绊到自己的尾巴。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Alsa greatly envies those who can dance gracefully around the campfire because she always ends up tripping over her own tail."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","因为无法获得大块的皮料，只能用碎片尽量拼接，所以乌尔氏族的人都很擅长缝纫，阿尔萨是其中的佼佼者。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Unable to obtain large pieces of leather, the Uru Clan has to make do with fragments. They're all skilled in sewing, but Alsa is exceptional."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿尔萨很多时候并没有找到多余的食物，她只是把自己的口粮省出了一些。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","When Alsa can't find enough food for the others, she dishes out her own rations."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，最开始见到阿尔萨时，我吓了一跳呢！就看到一个球形从远方向我们滚来……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Honestly, when I first laid eyes on Alsa rolling towards us from a distance, I was scared..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Chippy & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","好了吗？烤肉好了吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","How's the meat coming along? Is it ready yet?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索恩 & 阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Soren & Alsa"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","如果可以选降生地的话，谁会选在这光秃秃的沙海呢？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Who'd choose to be born in this barren desert if they had a choice?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","不知道索恩有没有这种感觉，残阳武斗场跟我想象中的不太一样。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Soren, I'm not sure how you're feeling, but this Sunseek Arena is nothing like what I imagined."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 索恩 & 曼卡拉"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Soren & Mikola"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","你们感受到了吗？刚才刮过来一阵清凉的风。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Did you feel it? A refreshing breeze."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411100.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411100.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","小的时候觉得这片沙漠无边无际，就是跑断腿也走不到尽头。"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","When I was little, this desert seemed so vast and boundless. I thought I would run to my death without reaching the edge."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411110.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411110.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","远处武斗场的呼声又传来了，你们听到了吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","More cheering from the arena! Do you hear that?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411130.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411130.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 满满 & 曼卡拉"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Chippy & Mikola"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","好好休息，我可以守夜。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Get some rest. I'll keep watch."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411150.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411150.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Shakir & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","难得看到布鲁特斯大人在这里休息！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","It's rare to see Lord Brutus rest here!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411170.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411170.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","棍子前端断了。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","The tip of the stick has broken."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415028.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415028.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","索恩 & 阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Soren & Alsa"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","索恩，树莓味道很不错吧？"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","The raspberries taste heavenly, don't they, Soren?"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415029.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415029.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","椅子好软啊！"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","This chair is so soft!"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415084.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415084.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","有什么水果吗？"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Do you serve fruits?"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415085.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415085.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯大人！隆冬节快乐！今年节日您有什么安排吗？"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Lord Brutus! Happy Winter Carnival! Do you have any exciting plans for the holiday this year?"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415344.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415344.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","雪花！星星灯！好漂亮！"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","Snowflakes! Starry lights! Everything's so beautiful!"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415393.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415393.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","一起来做节日大餐吧！"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","Let's make the banquet food together!"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415394.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415394.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","哇，好热闹啊！"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","Wow, I'm pumped up!"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415565.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415565.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","今晚一起去看灯吧！"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","Let's watch the lights together tonight!"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415566.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415566.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Alsa"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，那位蛮血朋友！你手臂上的是护腕吗？你的拳套去哪了？"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","Hey there, friend! Are those armguards on your arms? Where'd you leave your gauntlets?"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415810.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415810.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","坦布尔 & 阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Brock & Alsa"]]}